00:03:39,292 --> 00:03:41,697
therefore they also have to deal with hash

85
00:03:41,697 --> 00:03:42,323
collisions.

86
00:03:42,917 --> 00:03:45,501
They're just smart enough to allocate

87
00:03:46,223 --> 00:03:48,887
enough space, to derive the hash in an

88
00:03:48,935 --> 00:03:51,727
efficient way, and do a lot of tweaks that

